# Messages

::summary
The Messages two-plane surface in the shell wrapper, AUTHORED as real markup (G2/G3): a `split-pane` with the roster RAIL as the left pane (workspace-scoped conversation rows carrying `action=openConversation`, unread attr = right-side blue dot + accent count pill in meta) and the THREAD as the right pane (header, bubbles, attach ＋, composer per `thread.surf`), plus the icon-only New Conversation title-row action (G3). Side by side at wide and medium; at ≤ 767px the rail is alone until `data-thread=open` swaps in the thread, led by the renderer-emitted back control (`backToRoster`). Contacts are dead; conversation membership is the only access boundary.
::

